{"text": " to hunt for oil, but we don't have to do much hunting because we have the most oil of any nation anywhere, oil and gas in the world. And if you add coal, we have the most of any nation in the world. Clean \u2014 I call it clean, beautiful coal. You can do things today with coal that you couldn't have done 10 years ago, 15 years. So I have a little standing order in the White House. Never use the word coal, only use the words clean, beautiful coal. Sounds much better, doesn't it? But we stand ready to provide any country with abundant, affordable energy supplies if you need them, when most of you do.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.38, "text": " to hunt for oil, but we don't have to do much hunting because we have the most oil of any", "tokens": [50365, 281, 12454, 337, 3184, 11, 457, 321, 500, 380, 362, 281, 360, 709, 12599, 570, 321, 362, 264, 881, 3184, 295, 604, 50634], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1727889795772365, "compression_ratio": 1.763779527559055, "no_speech_prob": 1.965632934197714e-10}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 5.38, "end": 8.96, "text": " nation anywhere, oil and gas in the world.", "tokens": [50634, 4790, 4992, 11, 3184, 293, 4211, 294, 264, 1002, 13, 50813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1727889795772365, "compression_ratio": 1.763779527559055, "no_speech_prob": 1.965632934197714e-10}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 8.96, "end": 13.8, "text": " And if you add coal, we have the most of any nation in the world.", "tokens": [50813, 400, 498, 291, 909, 10209, 11, 321, 362, 264, 881, 295, 604, 4790, 294, 264, 1002, 13, 51055], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1727889795772365, "compression_ratio": 1.763779527559055, "no_speech_prob": 1.965632934197714e-10}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 13.8, "end": 15.52, "text": " Clean \u2014 I call it clean, beautiful coal.", "tokens": [51055, 18463, 3466, 286, 818, 309, 2541, 11, 2238, 10209, 13, 51141], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.172788979577